Package: stichos
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Maintainer: stichos maintainers <stichos@reinartz.io>
Description: Proof before publish — document inspection and rendering tool
 stichos is a read-only tool for analyzing office documents.
 It inspects structure, renders to images, and reports on layout quality.
Recommends: libreoffice | libreoffice-core, poppler-utils, ghostscript
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
